      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:15fbcd47e92f938778d3ebadc2eca97f0200de10e20c4ba41043d7d4a67908e4",
      "text": "Regulatory evidence for Parkinson\u2019s therapies spans medicinal-product guidance, biomarker support and qualification, drug applications and approvals, and device supplements. EMA distinguishes its effective guideline from a concept paper proposing revision. Biomarker support letters have a narrower meaning than qualification. Concrete examples illustrate FDA drug applications, a device supplement, and distinct European authorisation routes. Sponsor announcements are attributed separately from regulator records. FDA\u2019s discussion of real-world evidence also documents limits on its use in labeling.",
